#MOBILE
Vnum       40601
Keywords   jake fenn master temple~
Short      Jake Fenn~
Long       Jake Fenn stands before a half-finished mural, brush in hand.
~
Desc       Jake Fenn, Master of Bodhi, treats every art form as another
language for the same underlying truths the rest of the Order reaches
for through meditation and the blade. He is as likely to answer a
question with a song as with words.
~
Race       Human~
Position   standing~
DefPos     standing~
Gender     male~
Actflags   npc sentinel~
